proxide-rotlib-mosaist
Copyright (c) 2026 Proxide Contributors

This crate implements file format specifications and readers for the proprietary
binary rotamer library format (`rotlib.bin`) of the Mosaist / MASTER protein design
suite (Grigoryan lab, Dartmouth College; https://grigoryanlab.org/mosaist/).

